        "title": "就 / 假如: 假如…就 introduces a supposition",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "假如…就 introduces a supposition and its result. The supposed situation need not be established fact.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "假如你来，我就去。",
                "pinyin": "jiǎrú nǐ lái ， wǒ jiù qù 。",
                "meaning": "If you came, I would go.",
                "audio": "b72b46bf69bb325c06da8bac18b8fd735df3b4b4b7fc5eeca5f3bca2b30ff32a"
              },
              {
                "text": "假如下雨，就在家学习。",
                "pinyin": "jiǎrú xiàyǔ ， jiù zài jiā xuéxí 。",
                "meaning": "If it rains, study at home.",
                "audio": "828b34a04e89b61b984f03028f0c4d8da4c4cea915cf86d8225729e35ffc1493"
              }
            ]
